-- site: `check` exited 0, `medaka build` exited 0 and the native binary printed the right
-- answer, and `medaka run` panicked `intToString: not an Int` -- dict UNDER-application,
-- not a type error. Three verbs, three different answers.
--
-- ⚠️ ONLY THIS GATE CAN SEE IT. A corpus that grades `check` output is blind (check was
